{'symbol': 'TDG', 'date': '2021-05-11 07:15:00', 'title': 'TRANSDIGM GROUP REPORTS FISCAL 2021 SECOND QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': "CLEVELAND, MAY 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TRANSDIGM GROUP INCORPORATED (NYSE: TDG), A LEADING GLOBAL DESIGNER, PRODUCER AND SUPPLIER OF HIGHLY ENGINEERED AIRCRAFT COMPONENTS, TODAY REPORTED RESULTS FOR THE SECOND QUARTER ENDED APRIL\xa03, 2021, WHICH WERE SIGNIFICANTLY IMPACTED BY THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC. SECOND QUARTER HIGHLIGHTS INCLUDE: NET SALES OF $1,194 MILLION, DOWN 17.3% FROM $1,443 MILLION IN THE PRIOR YEAR'S QUARTER; INCOME FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $105 MILLION; EARNINGS PER SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $1.79; EBITDA AS DEFINED MARGIN OF 43.5%, REPRESENTING SEQUENTIAL IMPROVEMENT; EBITDA AS DEFINED OF $519 MILLION; ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $2.58; AND POSITIVE OPERATING CASH FLOW GENERATION OF $98 MILLION."}{'symbol': 'TDG', 'date': '2021-05-11 07:15:00', 'title': 'TRANSDIGM GROUP REPORTS FISCAL 2021 SECOND QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': "CLEVELAND, MAY 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TRANSDIGM GROUP INCORPORATED (NYSE: TDG), A LEADING GLOBAL DESIGNER, PRODUCER AND SUPPLIER OF HIGHLY ENGINEERED AIRCRAFT COMPONENTS, TODAY REPORTED RESULTS FOR THE SECOND QUARTER ENDED APRIL\xa03, 2021, WHICH WERE SIGNIFICANTLY IMPACTED BY THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC. SECOND QUARTER HIGHLIGHTS INCLUDE: NET SALES OF $1,194 MILLION, DOWN 17.3% FROM $1,443 MILLION IN THE PRIOR YEAR'S QUARTER; INCOME FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $105 MILLION; EARNINGS PER SHARE FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS OF $1.79; EBITDA AS DEFINED MARGIN OF 43.5%, REPRESENTING SEQUENTIAL IMPROVEMENT; EBITDA AS DEFINED OF $519 MILLION; ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $2.58; AND POSITIVE OPERATING CASH FLOW GENERATION OF $98 MILLION."}{'symbol': 'TDG', 'date': '2021-05-11 07:15:00', 'title': 'TRANSDIGM GROUP REPORTS FISCAL 2021 SECOND QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': "CLEVELAND, MAY 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TRANSDIGM GROUP INCORPORATED (NYSE: TDG), A LEADING GLOBAL DESIGNER, PRODUCER AND SU